================================================================================
What this is
================================================================================
UVBake is a standalone, clean-room, managed-C# tool that automatically generates
a UV atlas for a mesh — a unique, non-overlapping parameterization with large,
low-distortion islands, normalized texel density, and seams on hard edges, built
for downstream texture/normal baking. No third-party source code is copied into
it; the algorithms it implements are described in the works below, and any
permissively-licensed reference unwrappers are used only as an offline test
oracle (run locally to emit golden outputs, never linked or redistributed).

